[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6362.07, "timestamp": "01:46:02", "text": "以建立联系的方式，这样我就可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6365.109, "timestamp": "01:46:05", "text": "比如举办一个大型活动之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6367.51, "timestamp": "01:46:07", "text": "这可以让我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6369.189, "timestamp": "01:46:09", "text": "某种程度上，我感觉自己想要这样。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6369.581, "timestamp": "01:46:09", "author": "@DinyoFoxy", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DGXvUKi0q0ld5Zo5CNG2tmulZfZqg_h6ivQHLtQfKyx-z_EjHr-Bx7limqyg4JtpZ00_XP_BTQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "how are you doing"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6372.47, "timestamp": "01:46:12", "text": "在这个网络红人领域我做得还不多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6375.109, "timestamp": "01:46:15", "text": "虽然其他人都这么说，但事实并非如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6377.43, "timestamp": "01:46:17", "text": "他说这位骑师做了很多事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6379.03, "timestamp": "01:46:19", "text": "这个社区以及所有的一切，但仍然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6381.43, "timestamp": "01:46:21", "text": "我觉得自己没做什么事。所以，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6384.629, "timestamp": "01:46:24", "text": "我当时在想，我会举办一个类似活动之类的活动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6387.669, "timestamp": "01:46:27", "text": "日本虚拟主播和其他类似角色"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6390.629, "timestamp": "01:46:30", "text": "引入虚拟主播（VTuber）也像一个巨大的……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6393.35, "timestamp": "01:46:33", "text": "活动或其他什么事。这样他们就可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6395.59, "timestamp": "01:46:35", "text": "联系、互动、交流，一切都应顺畅进行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6399.75, "timestamp": "01:46:39", "text": "那有助于他们……那有助于他们……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6402.55, "timestamp": "01:46:42", "text": "它叫什么？呃，建立联系"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6404.629, "timestamp": "01:46:44", "text": "现在就可以交朋友什么的了，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6407.27, "timestamp": "01:46:47", "text": "如今我觉得对于大多数IMTuber来说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6409.27, "timestamp": "01:46:49", "text": "或者对大多数人来说，这很难做到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6412.79, "timestamp": "01:46:52", "text": "找日本人聊聊天什么的，因为大多数"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6415.83, "timestamp": "01:46:55", "text": "他们中有些人英语不好，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6419.109, "timestamp": "01:46:59", "text": "很少见，很难见到这样的人。"}]